      "statusChangeNewStatus": "available in future release",
      "value": "The slowdown was largely caused by this tool rescanning for conflicting IDs every time the UI was interacted with. This will be replaced with scanning once as the window opens and adding a button to allow you to rescan again manually.\n\nWe're adding pagination to this tool to avoid slow performance when working in a project containing several hundred networked objects.",
